# Ball, cylindrical, planar and slot mates (F9): with nothing fitting
# selected, Mate Slot says what to select; two circles picked are not a
# slot's line and point, and the mate says so and makes nothing. The
# same circles made a ball mate put the second plate's hole centre on
# the first's; set to move in a mechanism, the plate's screen says it
# turns about that point, a ball joint.
file $testdata/ui/screw_pair.tlspr
menu File|Open...
key f
answer ok
menu Assembly|Mate Slot
click-entity 80030045
click-entity 80040045
answer ok
menu Assembly|Mate Slot
click-entity 80030045
click-entity 80040045
menu Assembly|Mate Ball
click-tw g004-b
click-tw moves in a mechanism
tw
